# (build 112) The AUDIO page's PATCHES: ON plays the patch file's instruments (assets/music/
# q_patches.json) in place of the ROM's, OFF the ROM's alone
# (docs/audio.md, "Build 112"). It is Q's: route_probe is built without Q
# and the chip plays, so the line under it says Q ONLY and the title's theme
# plays on through every change. Two values: left, right and C each flip it.
# The route reads its own settings.json, never the player's.
start new
sound render on
wait screen title
wait ticks 420
press esc
expect escape-menu open
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press c
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
expect audio patches ON / Q ONLY
press right
expect audio patches OFF / Q ONLY
wait ticks 10
shot page_patches_off
expect sound playing
press left
expect audio patches ON / Q ONLY
press c
expect audio patches OFF / Q ONLY
press c
expect audio patches ON / Q ONLY
wait ticks 12
expect sound playing
press b
press b
expect escape-menu closed
